  "confirmedFindings": [],
  "limits": [
    "Existing geometry persistence test leaves owned synthetic app .local/test-fixtures directories; it does not write published results, and universal cleanup is not claimed.",
    "Legacy runOracle has additional helper calls beyond its six-element restoration corpus. The collector invokes it again after the 28-test child. The geometry35 tally does not include either legacy run.",
    "SVG is editable-projection-only; opaque native records and metadata are preserved but not rendered. Tiny/degenerate diamond clamping and transparent interior geometric selection remain explicit deviations.",
    "Collector accumulates child raw streams without a configured child timeout or log cap; finite frozen corpus passed, but adversarial/unbounded collector-output robustness is not demonstrated.",
    "No full original UI/renderer/default repair, original-grade security, performance superiority or real-world parity conclusion."
  ],
  "fullParity": false,
  "securityCertified": false,
  "performanceSuperiority": false
}
